Error [E0222]: A part of `CONFIG.name` cannot be moved independently
  --> static_partial_move.jet:11:27
    |
 11 |     size :: consume_name(^CONFIG.name)
    |                           ^^^^^^
 Why: Persistent and static storage must stay complete, and a value with its own Close implementation needs all its fields when it closes.
 Fix: Move the complete owner, copy a copyable field, or update persistent state atomically.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0222
